Scheme name:
xudanu

Status:
Provisional

Applications/protocols that use this scheme name:
The Xudanu hypertext document store (open source, Apache-2.0)
emits and parses these URIs in its wire protocol and its Model
Context Protocol (MCP) agent surface, to cite content with
span-stable, revision-pinnable addresses. Examples:

xudanu://work/42 current edition of work 42
xudanu://work/42?rev=3 revision 3, pinned and immutable
xudanu://work/42#span=10,150 characters 10-150 of the work

