References:
Xudanu URI Scheme v1.0 (the specification this registration
points at):
https://dgjones.info/xudanu/uri-scheme.html

Xudanu MCP Guide, section 5, "Addressing":
https://dgjones.info/xudanu/mcp-guide.html

The specification defines the syntax (ABNF grammar), component
semantics, canonical form and tolerated input, comparison rules,
dereferencing with BLAKE3 content-hash verification, and security
considerations. The authority literal "work" is reserved permanently,
which keeps v1 addresses unambiguous as future authority forms are
added in later revisions of the specification at the same URL.